- decided_at: 2026-09-19T22:21:55+00:00
  event: initial
  value: api_key_file path reference in config.json, resolved at read time; inline api_key still wins
  reason: Keeps secrets out of a config file that is otherwise safe to copy between machines or paste into a bug report; the OSU tunnel key already lives at ~/.osu-llm/vllm-api-key so duplicating it invites drift
- decided_at: 2026-09-19T22:33:11+00:00
  event: superseded-previous
  value: config.json holds references only (api_key_file); SaveSettings relocates any inline api_key to ~/.fastllm/keys/<id> at 0600 and rewrites the entry to point at it
  reason: Structural rather than advisory: config.json is the file most likely to be copied into a repo, gist, or bug report, so no code path present or future can write a credential into it. Relocation rather than stripping keeps existing inline keys working instead of silently deleting them.
